    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note: A New and Improved Version of Psychopomp has been released! Check out Psychopomp Gold!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771670/extras/6b642a721ba680bb6c5b2adc71c48ef4.avif?t=1729978610\" width=620 height=240 /></span>Welcome to the world of PSYCHOPOMP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are catacombs hidden under every building in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone knew about them, but lied to you about them your entire life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the depths, and see what awaits below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychopomp is a short Psychological Horror Dungeon Crawler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is wrong with the world, everything is not as you remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't know why, but everything draws you to the Earth, to the tunnels below. Do the answers await you there, or is something far worse in store?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Classic 3D Dungeon Crawler Gameplay!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique Creatures and Enemies, all sorts of bizarre horrors await you below!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Strange Secrets to Find!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Bizarre characters to encounter, maybe some friends along the way?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a unique and atmospheric world, and uncover the lies that have covered it all up!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the catacombs, and immerse yourself in a world that only grows darker the deeper you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your wits about you, watch your back, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771670/extras/6542bd08df4b84aee6e0f573043407c5.poster.avif?t=1729978610\" width=186 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771670/extras/6542bd08df4b84aee6e0f573043407c5.webm?t=1729978610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771670/extras/6542bd08df4b84aee6e0f573043407c5.poster.avif?t=1729978610\" width=186 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771670/extras/6542bd08df4b84aee6e0f573043407c5.webm?t=1729978610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771670/extras/6542bd08df4b84aee6e0f573043407c5.poster.avif?t=1729978610\" width=186 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771670/extras/6542bd08df4b84aee6e0f573043407c5.webm?t=1729978610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
